The Chief Transformation Officer recommends that:

1. The Board of Management of the Toronto Zoo approve in principle the terms and conditions of a lease agreement (the "Lease") with the Governing Council of the University of Toronto (the "Tenant") in respect of the Toronto Zoo Community Conservation Centre at the property municipally known as 2000 Meadowvale Road (the "Leased Premises"), as set out in Confidential Attachment 1 to this report;

2. Subject to the adoption of Recommendation 1, the the Board of Management of the Toronto Zoo authorize the Chief Executive Officer of the Toronto Zoo, on behalf of the Board, to negotiate and execute the Lease among the City of Toronto, Board of Management of the Toronto Zoo, and the Tenant, consistent with the terms and conditions contained in Confidential Attachment 1 to this report, and in a form satisfactory to the City Solicitor;

